meta {
  name: getEtimClasses
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getEtimClasses",
    "params": {
      "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
      "limit": 3
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve ETIM classes with optional translations. Defaults to latest version per class.

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–2500) |
  | `etim_release` | string (nullable) | no | Filter by ETIM release (e.g. "ETIM-9.0") |
  | `etim_class_code` | string (nullable) | no | Filter by exact ETIM class code (e.g. "EC000001") |
  | `etim_class_type` | string (nullable) | no | Filter by class type: REGULAR, MODELLING, or CONNECTION |
  | `search_query` | string (nullable) | no | Free-text search on class description, code, or synonyms |
  | `include_languages` | string[] (nullable) | no | Language codes to include translations for (e.g. ["nl", "en"]) |

  **Example: Classes for ETIM-10.0**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getEtimClasses",
    "params": {
      "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
      "limit": 3
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "etim_classes": [
      {
        "etim_class_code": "EC002713",
        "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
        "etim_group_code": "EG000034",
        "etim_class_version": 10,
        "etim_class_revision": 0,
        "drawing_url": null,
        "is_published": true,
        "is_deleted": false
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 1,
      "items_per_page": 3,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
